# LOCKED GALLERY MODULE — DO NOT MODIFY WITHOUT EXPLICIT USER APPROVAL

The Gallery module is an approved, frozen baseline. Do not change, redesign, restyle, restyle-via-globals, add, remove, resize, or reposition anything in it unless the user explicitly requests that specific Gallery change in the current conversation.

This lock is independent of the Login Page, Dashboard, Clients Management, Calendar, Bookings, and Invoice locks. All remain fully in force.

## Before editing any file below

Require an explicit user instruction that clearly asks to modify Gallery (for example: “change the Gallery cards” or “update the Gallery lightbox”). Unrelated work, other modules, refactors, “while we’re here” polish, and inferred improvements are not approval.

